Value Required IP_ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value Required MAC_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value Required VLAN_ID (\d+)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value AGING (\S+)
Value Required TYPE (\S+)

Start
  ^Type:\s+S-Static\s+D-Dynamic
  ^IP\s+Address\s+MAC\s+Address\s+VID\s+Interface/Link\s+ID\s+Aging\s+Type
  ^${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${VLAN_ID}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${AGING}\s+${TYPE}\s* -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error
